      ro: "Centrala electrică Drax este o facilitate energetică majoră din North Yorkshire care joacă un rol vital în securitatea energetică a țării. A trecut de la cărbune la biomasă, fiind cel mai mare generator de energie regenerabilă.",
      en: "Drax is a large biomass-fired power station in North Yorkshire that plays a vital role in the UK's energy security. It has transitioned from coal to biomass and is the country's single largest generator of renewable electricity.",
